messages[14]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hi is this DCoders insurance
  user_2,Ah yes this is DCoders How can I assist you today
  user_1,I'm calling about my life insurance policy I received a cancellation notice
  user_2,I'm so sorry to hear that Let me just check on the status of your policy [typing] Can you please confirm your policy number for me
  user_1,It's LP-001234
  user_2,Thank you [pause] I've located your policy It looks like it was cancelled due to non-payment of premium
  user_1,But I didn't receive any reminders or notifications [background noise: dog barks]
  user_2,I apologize for the inconvenience We did send out a notice but it's possible it was missed [hold music starts] Please hold for just a moment while I check on the details
  user_2,[hold music ends] I've checked and it seems the notice was sent to your email address on file [pause] Would you like to reinstate your policy
  user_1,Yes please How much do I need to pay
  user_2,[typing] Let me just calculate the amount [pause] You would need to pay the overdue premium plus a small reinstatement fee
  user_1,Okay that sounds good Can I pay over the phone
  user_2,Yes of course [background noise: keyboard typing] I just need to take your payment information
  user_1,Wait I just realized I don't have my payment info with me Can I call back later
  user_2,Of course Pranav You can call back at your convenience However please note that your policy will remain cancelled until payment is made